      "Fix": "Cut the sequence off before or just after touchdown on a single small, unresolved physical detail\u2014Wen\u0027s calibration marks going dark, or Teo\u0027s crate by the door\u2014rather than narrating the full technical success of the landing, so the last note is one unaccounted-for weight rather than a completed process."
